# Version and release

Before changing any version number, **look up the live version first**. Do not increment from repo files alone.

Check all of these, then set the next unused number:

1. Thunderstore latest: `https://thunderstore.io/api/experimental/package/LJIndustries/MulliganMadness/` (`latest.version_number`)
2. Repo: `thunderstore.toml` `versionNumber`, `manifest.json` `version_number`, `Plugin.Version`
3. CI: `.github/workflows/publish-thunderstore.yml` auto-increments if the chosen version is already on Thunderstore

If Thunderstore is `0.3.3` and the repo still says `0.3.1`, the next ship is `0.3.4`, not `0.3.2`. Keep Plugin / toml / manifest in sync with the version that will actually publish.

Do not copy build output into r2modman profiles. Package for Thunderstore only (`package/`).

Do not push to `main` (or anywhere) unless the user explicitly asks in that message.
